{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"a1-practice-33","level":"A1","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"mein, dein, sein, ihr","bn":"আমার, তোমার, তার"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„আমার বাবা“ জার্মানে কোনটি?","options":["mein Vater","meine Vater","meinen Vater"],"answer":0,"id":"a1-practice-33-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Das ist ___ Mutter. (আমার)","options":["meinen","meine","mein"],"answer":1,"explanation":"die Mutter → meine।","id":"a1-practice-33-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ali hat ein Auto. ___ Auto ist neu.","options":["Ihr","Mein","Sein"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Ali ছেলে → sein।","id":"a1-practice-33-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Sara hat eine Tasche. ___ Tasche ist neu.","options":["Ihre","Seine","Ihr"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Sara মেয়ে, die Tasche → ihre।","id":"a1-practice-33-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich sehe ___ Bruder. (আমার)","options":["meine","meinen","mein"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Akkusativ: der → meinen।","id":"a1-practice-33-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Wo ist dein Schlüssel?“ মানে কী?","options":["আমার চাবি কোথায়?","তার চাবি কোথায়?","তোমার চাবি কোথায়?"],"answer":2,"id":"a1-practice-33-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Ich liebe meine Familie.“ মানে কী?","options":["আমি আমার পরিবারকে ভালোবাসি।","আমি তোমার পরিবারকে ভালোবাসি।","আমি তার পরিবারকে ভালোবাসি।"],"answer":0,"id":"a1-practice-33-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Sara: „Ihr Sohn ist klein.“ মানে কী?","options":["আমার ছেলে ছোট।","তার (সারার) ছেলে ছোট।","তোমার ছেলে ছোট।"],"answer":1,"explanation":"মেয়ের জিনিস → ihr।","id":"a1-practice-33-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich sehe ___ Hund.","options":["der","dem","den"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Akkusativ: der → den।","id":"a1-practice-33-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Er hat eine Schwester.“ মানে কী?","options":["তার একটি ভাই আছে।","তার কোনো বোন নেই।","তার একটি বোন আছে।"],"answer":2,"id":"a1-practice-33-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„die Tante“ মানে কী?","options":["চাচী, মামী, ফুফু, খালা","দাদী/নানী","স্ত্রী"],"answer":0,"id":"a1-practice-33-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„das Enkelkind“ মানে কী?","options":["মেয়ে","নাতি/নাতনি","শিশু (ছোট)"],"answer":1,"id":"a1-practice-33-q12"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Die Bluse ist gebraucht.“ মানে কী?","options":["ব্লাউজটি একদম নতুন।","ব্লাউজটি বিক্রি হয়ে গেছে।","ব্লাউজটি ব্যবহৃত।"],"answer":2,"id":"a1-practice-33-q13"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„das Kind“-এর Plural কোনটি?","options":["die Kinder","die Kinds","die Kinden"],"answer":0,"id":"a1-practice-33-q14"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Ich habe keinen Bruder.“ মানে কী?","options":["আমার ভাই এখানে নেই।","আমার কোনো ভাই নেই।","আমার একটি ভাই আছে।"],"answer":1,"id":"a1-practice-33-q15"}],"requires":{"grammar":22,"vocabulary":21}},"schema":1,"id":"a1-practice-33","level":"A1","test":[]}